AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series Day 2🚀

Topic: Amazon S3 (Simple Storage Service)

As part of my AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series, today we’ll dive into one of the most essential AWS services — Amazon S3.

 Whether you’re preparing for a DevOps or SRE interview, understanding S3 concepts like storage classes, versioning, and lifecycle policies is a must.

 Here are real-world S3 interview questions to help you strengthen your cloud fundamentals. 👇

🔹 S3 — Top Interview Questions for DevOps Engineers

What is Amazon S3 and how does it differ from traditional file storage?
 How does S3 store data and what are its main components?
 What are the different S3 storage classes available and their use cases?
 What is S3 Versioning and why is it important?
 What is an S3 Bucket and how do you create one securely?
 Explain the concept of S3 Object Keys and Metadata.
 What is the maximum object size that can be uploaded to S3?
 What is the difference between S3 Standard and S3 Intelligent-Tiering?
 What are S3 Lifecycle Policies and how do they reduce cost?
 What is S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) and how does it work?
 How do you host a static website on Amazon S3?
 What is the purpose of S3 Object Lock?
 What is the difference between SSE-S3, SSE-KMS, and SSE-C encryption?
 How do you secure an S3 bucket from public access?
 What are S3 Access Points and when should you use them?
 What is the difference between S3 Bucket Policy and IAM Policy?
 What is S3 Transfer Acceleration and when is it beneficial?
 How can you monitor S3 usage and performance?
 How do you integrate S3 with CloudFront for content delivery?
 What are pre-signed URLs and how are they used in DevOps pipelines?
 How do you use S3 in CI/CD workflows for artifact storage?
 How can Terraform or CloudFormation manage S3 resources?
 What is S3 Event Notification and what AWS services can it trigger?
 How do you handle data backup and recovery in S3?
 What is S3 Glacier and how does it help in cost optimization?
 How do you move objects between storage classes automatically?
 What is the consistency model of S3?
 How does S3 integrate with AWS Lambda?
 What are common best practices for securing and managing S3 buckets?
 How do you estimate and optimize S3 costs for large-scale projects?

💡 Pro Tip:
 Combine Versioning, Lifecycle Policies, and S3 Intelligent-Tiering to build a cost-efficient and highly durable storage solution — this combo is often discussed in real DevOps interviews.
